==Battleground==
*3 [[Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*2 [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 3.33~4.67 seconds<sup>100f~140f</sup>.
*5 [[Doge]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 23.33~33.33 seconds<sup>700f~1,000f</sup>.
*7 [[Snache]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 23.33~33.33 seconds<sup>700f~1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**20 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**15 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
**6 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**3 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

